flowchart TD
    Failure[Handler returns failure] --> Attempts[Count persisted retry attempts]
    Attempts --> Budget{Retry budget available?}
    Budget -- No --> Failed[Persist Failed]
    Budget -- Yes --> Backoff[Calculate exponential backoff]
    Backoff --> Retrying[Job -> Retrying]
    Retrying --> Attempt[Persist RetryAttempt]
    Attempt --> Schedule[Persist retry Schedule]
    Schedule --> Poll[SchedulerBackgroundService polls]
    Poll --> Due{RunAt due?}
    Due -- Yes --> Queue[Job -> Queued]
    Queue --> Worker[Worker claims again]
